==English==

===Noun===
'''connexions'''

# {{obsolete}}: Plural of [[connexion]].
* A British variant spelling of [[connection]]s. It is preferred by some because it is closer to the original Latin, connexionem from which the word originally derives. 

* Quotation - Jane Eyre: An Autobiography,by Charlotte Brontë, 1848
::''I saw he was going to marry her, for family, perhaps political reasons; because her rank and '''connexions''' suited him;'' 

